      "name": "BuffData.ts",
      "filePath": "src/data/BuffData.ts",
      "summary": "Central data registry and computation module for Voxel Blade buffs and debuffs: defines the BUFF_DEFS metadata table and BASIC_DEBUFF_POOL, and provides the logic to assemble a build's active buffs, apply perk-based potency/duration modifiers, convert buff types, compute buff effects, and format perk descriptions.",
      "tags": ["data-model", "buff-system", "game-data", "service", "perk"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Large data-driven TypeScript module using Record<string, BuffDefinition> lookups with dynamicDescription closures and a pipeline of buff transformation helpers."
    },
